  "an6.170-649:1.24": "",
  "an6.170-649:1.25": "…pe… parikkhayāya …pe… pahānāya …pe… khayāya …pe… vayāya …pe… virāgāya …pe… nirodhāya …pe… cāgāya …pe… paṭinissaggāya cha dhammā bhāvetabbā katame cha: dassanānuttariyaṃ …pe… anussatānuttariyaṃ …pe… katame cha buddhānussati …pe… katame cha aniccasaññā …pe… pamādassa bhikkhave abhiññāya …pe… pariññāya …pe… parikkhayāya …pe… pahānāya …pe… khayāya …pe… vayāya …pe… virāgāya …pe… nirodhāya …pe… cāgāya …pe… paṭinissaggāya ",
  "an6.170-649:1.26": "ime cha dhammā bhāvetabbā’ti. ",
  "an6.170-649:1.27": "idamavoca bhagavā. ",
  "an6.170-649:1.28": "attamanā te bhikkhū bhagavato bhāsitaṃ abhinandunti. ",
  "an6.170-649:1.29": "",
  "an6.170-649:1.30": "rāgādipeyyālo niṭṭhito. chakkanipāto samatto. "
